<title>USA: Monsanto shareholders approve spinoff.</title>
<headline>Monsanto shareholders approve spinoff.</headline>
<dateline>ST. LOUIS 1997-08-18</dateline>
<text>
<p>Monsanto Co said Monday its shareholders had approved the spinoff of its chemicals business as a separately traded company.</p>
<p>Previously, Monsanto said the spinoff of the company, to be named Solutia Inc, would be completed September 1.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787))</p>
</text>
